  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-mode=\"public\" data-zone=\"watchlist\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\" />\n<title>Watchlist · canopticon — CANOPTICON</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Standing, scheduled research on named subjects — the record checks itself between visits.\" />\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400;1,6..72,500;1,6..72,600&display=swap\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/styles.css?v=lvcgjt\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n<nav class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"nav-inner\">\n    <a href=\"/\" class=\"wordmark\">CANOPTICON<span class=\"dot\">·</span><span class=\"wordmark-sub\">The standing record</span></a>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"nav-toggle\" class=\"nav-toggle\" />\n    <label for=\"nav-toggle\" class=\"nav-burger\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><span></span></label>\n    <div class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"/\">Record</a>\n      <a href=\"/investigations\">Investigations</a>\n      <a href=\"/watchlist\" class=\"active\">Watchlist</a>\n      <a href=\"/method\">Method</a>\n      <a href=\"/search\" class=\"nav-search\"><span class=\"q\">/</span> ask the record</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n<main class=\"record-main\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<section class=\"watch-masthead\">\n  <div class=\"kicker\"><span class=\"live\"></span> Watchlist</div>\n  <h1 class=\"watch-h1\">You don't feed it. You watch it.</h1>\n  <p class=\"watch-lede\">\n    Add a subject to the watchlist and it keeps checking itself — not a one-time upload. Each\n    check searches for new sources, checks every new claim word-for-word against what it finds,\n    and keeps only what holds up. Watched subjects share one research slot: every few days,\n    whichever has gone longest without a check gets the next one. Nobody re-runs the research\n    by hand.\n  </p>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"watch-list-section\">\n  <div class=\"sec-h\"><span class=\"label\">On the watchlist</span><span class=\"coord\">6 SUBJECTS</span></div>\n  <div class=\"watch-list\"><div class=\"watch-row\">\n  <div class=\"watch-name\">Melanie Joly</div>\n  <div class=\"watch-meta\">added 18h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> last checked 9m ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> no file yet</div>\n</div><div class=\"watch-row\">\n  <div class=\"watch-name\"><a href=\"/s/mark-carney\">Mark Carney</a></div>\n  <div class=\"watch-meta\">added 19h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> last checked 8h ago</div>\n</div><div class=\"watch-row\">\n  <div class=\"watch-name\"><a href=\"/s/chrystia-freeland\">Chrystia Freeland</a></div>\n  <div class=\"watch-meta\">added 19h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> last checked 16h ago</div>\n</div><div class=\"watch-row\">\n  <div class=\"watch-name\">CRTC streaming regulation</div>\n  <div class=\"watch-meta\">added 19h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> last checked 17h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> no file yet</div>\n</div><div class=\"watch-row\">\n  <div class=\"watch-name\">Bank for International Settlements</div>\n  <div class=\"watch-meta\">added 19h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> last checked 17h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> no file yet</div>\n</div><div class=\"watch-row\">\n  <div class=\"watch-name\">Net-zero and carbon-credit finance</div>\n  <div class=\"watch-meta\">added 18h ago <span class=\"sep\">·</span> not checked yet — queued <span class=\"sep\">·</span> no file yet</div>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .watch-masthead { max-width: 720px; margin: 40px auto 0; padding: 0 24px; }\n  .watch-h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; margin: 12px 0 14px; color: var(--ink); text-wrap: balance; }\n  .watch-lede { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); }\n  .watch-list-section { max-width: 720px; margin: 40px auto 0; padding: 0 24px 80px; }\n  .watch-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; background: var(--rule); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: var(--r-lg); overflow: hidden; }\n  .watch-row { background: var(--surface); padding: 15px 18px; }\n  .watch-name { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 16.5px; color: var(--ink); }\n  .watch-name a { color: var(--ink); }\n  .watch-name a:hover { color: var(--accent-2); }\n  .watch-meta { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-mute); margin-top: 4px; }\n</style></div>\n</main>\n<aside class=\"trust\" aria-label=\"How this site verifies\">\n  <div class=\"trust-inner\">\n    <span class=\"trust-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span>\n    <p>\n      Every documented fact on this site is backed by a word-for-word quote\n      from a source document we have stored — checked by machine, not vouched\n      for. Disputed claims are shown as disputed. Claims that fail\n      verification are removed, and we say so.\n      <a href=\"/method\">How verification works →</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</aside>\n<footer class=\"foot\">\n  <div class=\"foot-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"wordmark\">CANOPTICON<span class=\"dot\">·</span></a>\n      <div class=\"coord\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">THE STANDING RECORD <span class=\"sep\">·</span> canopticon.com <span class=\"sep\">·</span> @canoptics</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot-links\">\n      <a href=\"/\">The Record</a>\n      <a href=\"/investigations\">Investigations</a>\n      <a href=\"/library\">Library</a>\n      <a href=\"/method\">Method</a>\n      <a href=\"/search\">Search</a>\n    </div>\n